# scrcpy options for the "Phone" entry, one per line (scrcpy --help lists them).
# Arguments given to phone-mirror come after these. install.sh writes this file
# once; reinstalling keeps your changes.
#
# Video size and frame rate: decoding takes CPU from games. VR windows render
# at 1280x720 anyway. --max-fps=60 scrolls smoother for a little more CPU.
--max-size=1280
--max-fps=30
# The phone's own screen stays off while mirrored (battery, privacy).
--turn-screen-off
#
# Others worth knowing:
#   --no-audio      keep the phone's sound on the phone
#   --stay-awake    the phone doesn't sleep (and lock) while mirrored; works only while it's charging
